(7774094, 1291843, 30214, '<td valign="top">
<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful image. Great mood. I would love to learn which duotone colors and curves you have used to achieve this. I tried but am unable to. </i></td></tr></table> Thank you! I used Silver Efex Pro Photoshop plug-in to convert to B&amp;W and add strong toning. It has separate color and strength controls for darker (silver) and lighter (paper) tones.</td>', 'Originally posted by willem: Beautiful image. Great mood. I would love to learn which duotone colors and curves you have used to achieve this. I tried but am unable to.  Thank you! I used Silver Efex Pro Photoshop plug-in to convert to B&W and add strong toning. It has separate color and strength controls for darker (silver) and lighter (paper) tones.', '2024-12-25 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7774102, 1291786, 30214, '<td valign="top">
